theory.intro:
The equation $x^{2}+y^{2}=r^{2}$ is a **circle with centre $(0,0)$ and radius $r$**. Every point $(x,y)$ on it is a distance $r$ from the origin, so $\sqrt{x^{2}+y^{2}}=r$ and squaring gives $x^{2}+y^{2}=r^{2}$.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.9]
\usetikzlibrary{calc}
\draw[<->] (-3.7,0) -- (3.7,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-3.7) -- (0,3.7) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[thick,blue] (0,0) circle (3);
\coordinate (O) at (0,0);
\coordinate (Q) at (2.12,0);
\coordinate (P) at (2.12,2.12);
\draw (O) -- (P) node[midway, above left] {$r$};
\draw (Q) -- (P) node[midway, left, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$y$};
\draw (O) -- (Q) node[midway, below, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$x$};
\coordinate (qa) at ($(Q)!0.3cm!(O)$);
\coordinate (qb) at ($(Q)!0.3cm!(P)$);
\draw (qa) -- ($(qa)+(qb)-(Q)$) -- (qb);
\fill (O) circle (2.5pt);
\node[below left] at (O) {$O$};
\fill (P) circle (2.5pt);
\node[above right] at (P) {$P(x,y)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

facts:
The circle cuts the axes at $(\pm r,0)$ and $(0,\pm r)$, four points a distance $r$ from the origin.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.9]
\draw[<->] (-3.8,0) -- (3.8,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-3.8) -- (0,3.8) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[thick,blue] (0,0) circle (3);
\fill (0,0) circle (2.5pt);
\node[below left] at (0,0) {$O$};
\fill (3,0) circle (2.5pt);
\node[above right] at (3,0) {$r$};
\fill (-3,0) circle (2.5pt);
\node[above left] at (-3,0) {$-r$};
\fill (0,3) circle (2.5pt);
\node[above right] at (0,3) {$r$};
\fill (0,-3) circle (2.5pt);
\node[below left] at (0,-3) {$-r$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

workedExamples.solution_text:
$\begin{align*}r&=\sqrt{8}\\&=2\sqrt{2}\end{align*}$
The centre is $(0,0)$. Plot $(\pm2\sqrt{2},0)$ and $(0,\pm2\sqrt{2})$, then draw the circle.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.75cm,y=0.75cm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black}]
\definecolor{circleblue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\draw[black,<->] (-3.8,0)--(3.8,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[black,<->] (0,-3.8)--(0,3.8) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[circleblue,thick] (0,0) circle ({sqrt(8)});
\fill[black] (0,0) circle (1.5pt);
\node[below left] at (0,0) {$(0,0)$};
\fill[black] ({sqrt(8)},0) circle (1.5pt);
\fill[black] ({-sqrt(8)},0) circle (1.5pt);
\fill[black] (0,{sqrt(8)}) circle (1.5pt);
\fill[black] (0,{-sqrt(8)}) circle (1.5pt);
\node[below right] at ({sqrt(8)},0) {$2\sqrt{2}$};
\node[below left] at ({-sqrt(8)},0) {$-2\sqrt{2}$};
\node[above right] at (0,{sqrt(8)}) {$2\sqrt{2}$};
\node[below right] at (0,{-sqrt(8)}) {$-2\sqrt{2}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

