workedExamples.solution_text:
The radius is the hypotenuse of a right-angled triangle with perpendicular sides $8$ and $15$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.16cm,y=0.16cm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black}]
\definecolor{circleblue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\draw[black,<->] (-20,0)--(20,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[black,<->] (0,-20)--(0,20) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[circleblue,thick] (0,0) circle (17);
\draw[black] (0,0)--(-8,15) node[midway,above right] {$r$};
\draw[black,dashed] (-8,0)--(-8,15) node[midway,left] {$15$};
\node[below] at (-4,0) {$8$};
\draw[black] (-6.8,0)--(-6.8,1.2)--(-8,1.2);
\fill[black] (0,0) circle (1.5pt);
\node[below right] at (0,0) {$O$};
\fill[black] (-8,15) circle (1.5pt);
\node[above left] at (-8,15) {$P(-8,15)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
$\begin{align*}r^{2}&=8^{2}+15^{2}\\r^{2}&=64+225\\r^{2}&=289\\r&=17\end{align*}$
The equation is $x^{2}+y^{2}=289$.

